1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Reqix: turn real requests into controlled responses

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
01  Open Reqix in the right-hand DevTools panel and reload

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,600
Create a Modify Response Data rule from the request row

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:13,800
02  Set the response body to {"products":[],"total":0}

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:18,700
Enable the rule and save

6
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,900
Return to the page and reload the request

7
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:24,900
The response is empty and the page shows its empty state

8
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,500
03  Open Reqix in the toolbar and turn the extension off

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,000
Turn Reqix off and reload: the three products return

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,600
Turn Reqix back on and reload the page

11
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,100
The empty state returns: verify the mock again

12
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:41,000
